<title>INDIA: India SIV halts work at factory-agency.</title>
<headline>India SIV halts work at factory-agency.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SIV Industries Ltd halted work at its chemical unit near the southern Indian city of Coimbatore on Friday after a court ruled against its effluents flowing into a river, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said.</p>
<p>The news agency quoted a company spokesman as saying that operations had come to a standstill to ensure that no effluent was let out into the River Bhavani from Saturday, following an order from the Madras high court.</p>
<p>SIV, earlier called Southern India Viscose, had filed a petition against the high court order in the Supreme Court, PTI said.</p>
</text>
